        ],
        "text": "- launch terminal\nTAP cmd\nDELAY .4\nSTRING terminal\nDELAY .1\nTAP enter\nDELAY 1.5\nPRESS ctrl\nPRESS r\nRELEASE_ALL\nDELAY .2\nSTRING tio /dev/ttyUSB0 -b 115200 -d 8 -p none -s 1 -f none --socket unix:/tmp/tio.sock\nDELAY .4\nTAP tab\nDELAY .4\nTAP enter\n- now launch side powershell\nDELAY .5\nPRESS ctrl\nPRESS shift\nPRESS 1\nRELEASE_ALL\n- switch tab back to tio\nPRESS ctrl\nPRESS tab\nRELEASE_ALL\nTAP enter\n- now launch side powershell (admin)\nDELAY .5\nPRESS ctrl\nPRESS shift\nPRESS 6\nRELEASE_ALL\n- attach usb\n-STRING usbipd attach --wsl --busid 6-3\n-DELAY .4\n-TAP enter\n-RELEASE_ALL"
      }
